 [3.2] Laravel Sail + MySQL
   • composer require laravel/sail --dev (v1.67)
   • php artisan sail:install --with=mysql
   • HASIL: compose.yaml (Sail versi baru memakai nama file
     "compose.yaml", bukan "docker-compose.yml")
       - service laravel.test : PHP 8.5 (image sail-8.5/app)
       - service mysql        : mysql:8.4, volume sail-mysql
   • sail up -d → kedua kontainer BERJALAN
       karen-laravel.test-1  : Up
       karen-mysql-1         : Up (healthy)

 [3.3] Konfigurasi .env (development)
   • APP_NAME=Karen
   • DB_CONNECTION=mysql | DB_HOST=mysql | DB_PORT=3306
   • DB_DATABASE=karen    | DB_USERNAME=sail | DB_PASSWORD=password

 [3.4] Laravel Breeze (Blade stack) v2.4
   • Scaffold auth lengkap (login, logout, reset password,
