     di Fase 1), layout app/guest, komponen Blade

 [3.5] Penyesuaian Tailwind CSS v3 → v4 (akibat spec responsive)
   • Scaffold Breeze semula campuran: plugin @tailwindcss/vite v4
     namun core tailwindcss ^3.1 dengan directive v3
   • app.css ditulis ulang ke paradigma v4 (@import 'tailwindcss'
     + @plugin '@tailwindcss/forms' + @source blade)
   • tailwind.config.js & postcss.config.js DIHAPUS (tidak perlu
     di v4); npm uninstall autoprefixer postcss
   • npm install -D tailwindcss@^4 → v4.3.3
   • Build sukses: CSS 21.67 kB (gzip 6 kB), tanpa directive v3

