 6. PERINTAH SAIL HARIAN (REFERENSI)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

   ./vendor/bin/sail up -d        nyalakan kontainer
   ./vendor/bin/sail down         matikan kontainer
   ./vendor/bin/sail ps           status kontainer
   ./vendor/bin/sail logs -f      ikuti log laravel.test
   ./vendor/bin/sail artisan ...  perintah artisan (migrate, dll)
   ./vendor/bin/sail composer ... kelola dependensi PHP
   ./vendor/bin/sail npm ...      npm (install/run dev/build)
   ./vendor/bin/sail test         jalankan test suite
   ./vendor/bin/sail mysql        masuk console MySQL

   (opsional) tambahkan di ~/.config/fish/config.fish:
   alias sail './vendor/bin/sail'

